# Silithus (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Silithus: 3 contracted quests (band 58-60,
# docs/silithus-horde-census.md). 9416/9422 are the Horde intro mirrors
# (Scout Bloodfist to General Kirika, far south); 8380 is the Shaman
# Armaments of War, gated only Shaman, its pre 8315 bridged by a dedicated
# when-onquest mini (the shared Calling chain lives in the main guide).
# 9422's dust-turnin doodad has no spawn record - same as its Alliance
# twin's - so the complete rides at Kirika's data-placed point, stated.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silithus-horde
title Silithus (Horde)
levels 58-60
zone Silithus
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Cenarion Hold - Bloodfist report

  zone map 1451

  note The Horde entry: Scout Bloodfist holds the north edge of the Hold. Take his report here; it sends you south to General Kirika.
  accept 9416 -- Report to General Kirika - Scout Bloodfist (48.95, 36.69)

step Cenarion Hold - Larksbane's calling (when onquest 8315)

  zone map 1451

  when onquest 8315

  note Armaments of War (8380) needs The Calling (8315) turned in first - 8315 is shared content routed in the main silithus.guide. Holders proceed; others work the main guide's Calling chain, then return.
  accept 8380 only Shaman -- Armaments of War - Geologist Larksbane (49.67, 37.46)
  turnin 8380 only Shaman -- Armaments of War - back to Geologist Larksbane

step Deep south - Kirika's command

  zone map 1451

  note The long south run to General Kirika (50.75, 69.54), past the hives. Hand in Bloodfist's report, take her scouring ask, and work the dust doodad beside her.
  turnin 9416 -- Report to General Kirika - to General Kirika (50.75, 69.54)
  accept 9422 -- Scouring the Desert - General Kirika; the Horde dust doodad beside her (the Alliance twin 9419 works the same way for Marshal Bluewall)
  complete 9422 @50.75,69.54 -- the Silithus Dust Horde turnin doodad beside General Kirika (no placed spawn in the data - same as its Alliance twin; fill at her point)
  turnin 9422 -- Scouring the Desert - back to General Kirika
